{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120034234758-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120035112\"/><p>今日(20日)凌晨1時27分，一名尼泊爾裔男子，在油麻地上海街251號對開暈倒，其友人發現報案求助。救援人員接報到場，事主現場被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，事主早前曾向友人表示身體不適。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T20:03:02.641773+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T19:42:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:49:19.943159+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T19:56:31.378536+00:00","content_hash":"803e2b8fdd9e22b0cce2a8b52b1d0eb58f195f2fa3b48f18837715c2679a8320","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}